{"openapi":"3.0.1","info":{"title":"watchtogether-backend API 文档","description":"WatchTogether 后端 REST API - 同步视频观看平台。\n\n## 功能特性\n- **房间管理**: 创建、加入和管理观看房间\n- **会话管理**: 用户会话处理，支持Redis缓存\n- **实时通信**: Socket.io 实现同步视频播放和聊天\n- **文件上传**: 视频和图片上传支持\n- **表情系统**: 交互式表情反应功能\n\n## 认证方式\n当前使用基于会话令牌的认证方式。\n\n## Socket.io 事件\n实时事件通过Socket.io处理，端口19090。\n详情请参考SocketEventHandler类。\n","contact":{"name":"WatchTogether Team","url":"https://watchtogether.com","email":"contact@watchtogether.com"},"license":{"name":"MIT License","url":"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"},"version":"1.0.0"},"servers":[{"url":"http://localhost:18080","description":"Local development server"}],"security":[{"X-Session-Id":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"健康检查","description":"系统健康状态检查相关的API"},{"name":"房间管理","description":"创建、加入和管理观看房间相关的API"},{"name":"会话管理","description":"用户会话管理相关的API"},{"name":"表情系统","description":"表情管理和反应相关的API"},{"name":"文件上传","description":"视频和文件上传相关的API"}],"paths":{"/api/sessions/{sessionId}/profile":{"put":{"tags":["会话管理"],"summary":"更新用户资料","description":"更新用户的昵称和头像","operationId":"updateProfile","parameters":[{"name":"sessionId","in":"path","description":"会话ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"sess_abc123def456"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"更新资料请求参数"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiRespSessionResp"}}}}}}},"/api/sessions":{"post":{"tags":["会话管理"],"summary":"创建会话","description":"创建一个新的用户会话，返回会话ID和用户信息","operationId":"createSession","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"创建会话的请求参数"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiRespSessionResp"}}}}}}},"/api/sessions/{sessionId}/history/{historyId}/leave":{"post":{"tags":["会话管理"],"summary":"离开房间历史记录","description":"记录用户离开房间的历史","operationId":"leaveRoom","paramete